  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She tells first supreme elder Shi Zong that Moli Region was the wager of a bet a senior of her tribe won four hundred years ago. She smiles coldly that an agreement was set then. When he asks where the agreement is now, she is so angry she cannot speak. The snowmen lose the negotiation. After they return, she consoles Bing Zhuo about a thousand years of rockman attitude and the immemorial rock dragon, then lays a plan: marry Xue Er to Fang Yuan so the tribe is no longer bullied. She had sold snow lotus essence to Lang Ya Sect’s Sixth Hair to build that relationship. She calls Xue Er her granddaughter.",
      "chapters": [
        1459
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_zong",
        "char_bing_zhuo",
        "char_xue_er",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "char_sixth_hair"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shi Zong calls her Elder Bing Yuan. She is the grandmother of Xue Er and the one who initiated and planned the marriage with Fang Yuan. She pretends not to notice his mocking tone and answers while looking at the main table. This is an engagement ceremony, not the wedding she wanted. The snowmen paid a hefty price. On the surface she does not show any emotions. She smiles and interacts in the banquet.",
      "chapters": [
        1472
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "engagement-banquet",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan asks the remaining variant human Gu Immortals to join Lang Ya Sect, she is the first to agree: the snowman tribe will move over and join. This rank seven Gu Immortal is the grandmother of Fang Yuan’s fiancée, Xue Er. The other three submit after her. The snowman tribe then lives in Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal aperture, and she becomes Fang Yuan’s subordinate.",
      "chapters": [
        1765
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-to-agree",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She leads the snowman Gu Immortals and sends a wave of frost energy that freezes the enemies.",
      "chapters": [
        2107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "frost-energy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The snowman Gu Immortal behind Xue Er, Bing Yuan, trumpets that Xue Er is Fang Yuan’s fiancée until every Gu Immortal in the sovereign immortal aperture knows it. With Xue Er she will activate ice and snow killer moves, to freeze and slow down the growth of the vegetation.",
      "chapters": [
        2127
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-and-snow",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "race_snowmen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She, Golden Fur Immortal Monarch, and Shi Zong go to Human Smoke Mountain as snowman, hairy man, and rockman, all at rank eight. As the leader of the trip she speaks for the trade with Chai clan.",
      "chapters": [
        2137
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chai-clan-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_golden_fur_immortal_monarch",
        "loc_human_smoke_mountain",
        "fac_chai_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She was the last of the three to advance to rank eight, and she passed her tribulation with Fang Yuan’s help. Shi Zong and Golden Fur Immortal Monarch accept her leadership because she is Xue Er’s grandmother. She stops their fight with a dark expression, then smiles coldly at Chai clan.",
      "chapters": [
        2138
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chai-clan-trade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is a group of variant human Gu Immortals like Bing Yuan, Shi Zong, and Mo Tan Sang.",
      "chapters": [
        2142
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "variant-human-group",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_mo_tan_sang"
      ]
    }
  ],
